ー事業」セグメントに包含して報告しております。詳細は添付資料Ｐ.14「（セグメント情報）」及びＰ.19「（追加情報）」をご参照ください。３. 当連結会計年度において、希薄化後１株当たり当期利益金額については、潜在株式は存在するものの、１株当たり当期損失であるため記載しておりません。４. 当社は、2025年８月２日及び2025年９月１日付で普通株式１株につき10株の株式分割（合計１株につき100株）を行っております。「基本的１株当たり当期利益」は、前連結会計年度の期首に当該株式分割が行われたものと仮定して算定しております。", null, "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["総資産", "TotalAssets", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", 18943000000, "18,943", "JPY", "CurrentYearInstant_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["純資産合計", "NetAssets", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", 11001000000, "11,001", "JPY", "CurrentYearInstant_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["株主資本合計", "ShareholdersEquity", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", 11001000000, "11,001", "JPY", "CurrentYearInstant_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["自己資本比率（%）", "EquityToAssetRatio", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", 0.5810000000000001, "58.1", "Pure", "CurrentYearInstant_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["EquityAttributableToOwnersOfParentPerShareIFRS", "EquityAttributableToOwnersOfParentPerShareIFRS", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", 21.61, "21.61", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearInstant_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["総資産", "TotalAssets", "tse-ed-t", "前期末", 3164000000, "3,164", "JPY", "PriorYearInstant_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["純資産合計", "NetAssets", "tse-ed-t", "前期末", 1743000000, "1,743", "JPY", "PriorYearInstant_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["株主資本合計", "ShareholdersEquity", "tse-ed-t", "前期末", 1743000000, "1,743", "JPY", "PriorYearInstant_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["自己資本比率（%）", "EquityToAssetRatio", "tse-ed-t", "前期末", 0.551, "55.1", "Pure", "PriorYearInstant_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["EquityAttributableToOwnersOfParentPerShareIFRS", "EquityAttributableToOwnersOfParentPerShareIFRS", "tse-ed-t", "前期末", 4.02, "4.02", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearInstant_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["営業活動によるCF", "NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities", "tse-ed-t", "当期", 4939000000, "4,939", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["投資活動によるCF", "NetCashProvidedByUsedInInvestingActivi